      "message": "If we assert `oi_size\u003d\u003d0` here, why can you change the HFP_MSBC_PKT_LEN from 60 to 58?\nAlso the implementation of OI_CODEC_SBC_DecodeFrame mentions checking oi_size against frame length, please double check if we shall pass the real \"frame length\" 57 here.",
