      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see.\nLet\u0027s not touch decoder-sbc since there might be other users(e.g Android auto).\nInstead just express explicitly what we set for `io_size`\n```\n// Packet: 2 bytes header + 57 bytes mSBC + 1 byte padding.\noi_size \u003d HFP_MSBC_FRAME_LEN + 1;\n```",
